# Code owners for rassimok.dev
#
# Every line matches a path pattern; the last matching line wins.
# Owners are requested for review automatically when a PR touches their paths.
#
# GitHub never requests review from the PR author, so while this is a
# one-person project these lines are inert. They are here so that the moment
# a second person joins, the sensitive paths already route to the right
# reviewer instead of being noticed after something slips through.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                       @rassimok-dev

# Security headers. A careless edit here silently weakens the CSP for every
# visitor, and nothing in the page itself will look different.
/_headers               @rassimok-dev

# CI definition. These workflows are the only thing enforcing the
# no-JavaScript and zero-third-party guarantees; a change here can disable
# the checks rather than pass them.
/.github/workflows/     @rassimok-dev

# Conventions the assistant and contributors follow.
/CLAUDE.md              @rassimok-dev
